                            "id": 1,
                            "content": "The UAE Golden Visa offers 10-year renewable residency for investors, business owners, and high-net-worth individuals. With no local sponsor required and full business control, this program provides stability, global mobility, and access to one of the world’s most dynamic tax-efficient economies."
